    " hist:\"First state west of the Appalachians, carved from Virginia in 1792. Remained in the Union in 1861 though deeply divided; birthplace of both Lincoln and Jefferson Davis.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "LA:{n:\"Louisiana\",cap:\"Baton Rouge\",big:\"New Orleans\",adm:\"April 30, 1812\",ord:18,pop:4618189,pr:25,area:52378,ar:31,nick:\"Pelican State\",reg:\"South\",div:\"West South Central\",tz:\"Central\",\n",
