    " geo:\"Sometimes called America in Miniature: Atlantic beaches, the Chesapeake Bay, the Piedmont, and the Appalachian ridges within 250 miles. At Hancock the state narrows to under two miles wide. The Chesapeake is the largest estuary in the country.\",\n",
