    " cty:[\"Minneapolis\",\"St. Paul\",\"Rochester\",\"Bloomington\",\"Duluth\"],\n",
    " econ:\"Medical devices, health care (Mayo Clinic at Rochester), taconite iron ore, agriculture, and a concentration of large corporate headquarters.\",\n",
    " hist:\"Admitted 1858. Iron ore from the Mesabi Range supplied much of the steel for both world wars. Duluth is the farthest inland seaport in North America.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "MS:{n:\"Mississippi\",cap:\"Jackson\",big:\"Jackson\",adm:\"December 10, 1817\",ord:20,pop:2954160,pr:35,area:48432,ar:32,nick:\"Magnolia State\",reg:\"South\",div:\"East South Central\",tz:\"Central\",\n",
