    " cty:[\"Newark\",\"Jersey City\",\"Paterson\",\"Elizabeth\",\"Lakewood\"],\n",
    " econ:\"Pharmaceuticals and chemicals, the Port of New York and New Jersey (the largest on the East Coast), finance, and logistics along the Northeast Corridor.\",\n",
    " hist:\"Called the Crossroads of the Revolution: nearly 300 engagements were fought here, more than in any other state. Washington crossed the Delaware on the night of December 25, 1776. Third to ratify the Constitution.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "NM:{n:\"New Mexico\",cap:\"Santa Fe\",big:\"Albuquerque\",adm:\"January 6, 1912\",ord:47,pop:2125498,pr:36,area:121590,ar:5,nick:\"Land of Enchantment\",reg:\"West\",div:\"Mountain\",tz:\"Mountain\",\n",
