    " cty:[\"Charlotte\",\"Raleigh\",\"Greensboro\",\"Durham\",\"Winston-Salem\"],\n",
    " econ:\"Banking at Charlotte (second only to New York by assets), Research Triangle Park, biotechnology, furniture, and agriculture.\",\n",
    " hist:\"The Roanoke Colony of 1587 vanished without trace. The Wright brothers made the first powered flight at Kill Devil Hills on December 17, 1903. Twelfth to ratify the Constitution, after the Bill of Rights was promised.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "ND:{n:\"North Dakota\",cap:\"Bismarck\",big:\"Fargo\",adm:\"November 2, 1889\",ord:39,pop:799358,pr:47,area:70698,ar:19,nick:\"Peace Garden State\",reg:\"Midwest\",div:\"West North Central\",tz:\"Central / Mountain (southwest)\",\n",
    " hi:[\"White Butte\",3506],lo:[\"Red River of the North\",750],np:[\"Theodore Roosevelt\"],\n",
    " geo:\"The Red River Valley in the east is the bed of glacial Lake Agassiz, exceptionally flat and among the most fertile ground in North America. Westward the land rises to the Missouri Plateau and the badlands, eroded into ridges of clay and lignite.\",\n",
