    " hist:\"Admitted the same day as South Dakota. President Harrison shuffled the two bills so that no one could say which was signed first; alphabetical order settled the numbering.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "OH:{n:\"Ohio\",cap:\"Columbus\",big:\"Columbus\",adm:\"March 1, 1803\",ord:17,pop:11900510,pr:7,area:44826,ar:34,nick:\"Buckeye State\",reg:\"Midwest\",div:\"East North Central\",tz:\"Eastern\",\n",
