    " geo:\"Glaciated till plains cover the west; the unglaciated Allegheny Plateau covers the east and southeast with steep hollows and sandstone gorges. A low divide separates water flowing to Lake Erie from water flowing to the Ohio and the Gulf.\",\n",
    " feat:[\"Hocking Hills\",\"Cuyahoga Valley\",\"Lake Erie islands\",\"Serpent Mound\",\"Ohio River valley\"],\n",
