    " hist:\"First state carved from the Northwest Territory. Seven presidents were born here, more than any state but Virginia. The Cuyahoga River caught fire in 1969, helping drive passage of the Clean Water Act.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "OK:{n:\"Oklahoma\",cap:\"Oklahoma City\",big:\"Oklahoma City\",adm:\"November 16, 1907\",ord:46,pop:4123288,pr:28,area:69899,ar:20,nick:\"Sooner State\",reg:\"South\",div:\"West South Central\",tz:\"Central / Mountain (far panhandle)\",\n",
