    " geo:\"Eleven distinct ecoregions, from the pine forests of the Ouachitas through cross timbers and tallgrass prairie to shortgrass High Plains in the Panhandle. Sits at the heart of Tornado Alley, where dry continental air meets Gulf moisture.\",\n",
