    " hist:\"Terminus of the Oregon Trail; the 1846 treaty with Britain fixed the boundary at the 49th parallel. Since the Beach Bill of 1967 the entire coastline has been held in public trust.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "PA:{n:\"Pennsylvania\",cap:\"Harrisburg\",big:\"Philadelphia\",adm:\"December 12, 1787\",ord:2,pop:13059432,pr:5,area:46054,ar:33,nick:\"Keystone State\",reg:\"Northeast\",div:\"Middle Atlantic\",tz:\"Eastern\",\n",
    " hi:[\"Mount Davis\",3213],lo:[\"Delaware River\",0],np:[],\n",
    " geo:\"The Ridge and Valley province cuts diagonally across the state in long parallel folds, a pattern visible from orbit. The Allegheny Plateau covers the northwest, the Piedmont the southeast. The Marcellus Shale underlies most of the state.\",\n",
    " feat:[\"Pocono Mountains\",\"Pine Creek Gorge\",\"Delaware Water Gap\",\"Ohiopyle\",\"Presque Isle\",\"Allegheny National Forest\"],\n",
