    " econ:\"Natural gas from the Marcellus Shale (second largest producing state), health care and higher education, steel historically at Pittsburgh, and agriculture.\",\n",
    " hist:\"Both the Declaration of Independence and the Constitution were adopted in Philadelphia. Gettysburg, July 1863, was the largest battle ever fought in North America. The first commercial oil well was drilled at Titusville in 1859.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "RI:{n:\"Rhode Island\",cap:\"Providence\",big:\"Providence\",adm:\"May 29, 1790\",ord:13,pop:1114521,pr:44,area:1545,ar:50,nick:\"Ocean State\",reg:\"Northeast\",div:\"New England\",tz:\"Eastern\",\n",
