    " hist:\"First state to secede, on December 20, 1860; the Civil War opened at Fort Sumter on April 12, 1861. Charleston was the principal port of entry for enslaved Africans arriving in North America.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "SD:{n:\"South Dakota\",cap:\"Pierre\",big:\"Sioux Falls\",adm:\"November 2, 1889\",ord:40,pop:935094,pr:46,area:77116,ar:17,nick:\"Mount Rushmore State\",reg:\"Midwest\",div:\"West North Central\",tz:\"Central / Mountain (western half)\",\n",
