    " geo:\"Three provinces meet here: the slickrock canyons of the Colorado Plateau, the Basin and Range to the west, and the Middle Rockies to the northeast. The Great Salt Lake is the largest saltwater lake in the Western Hemisphere and has no outlet. Arches contains over 2,000 documented natural stone arches.\",\n",
    " feat:[\"Great Salt Lake\",\"Bonneville Salt Flats\",\"Zion Canyon\",\"Bryce amphitheater\",\"Delicate Arch\",\"Monument Valley\"],\n",
