    " econ:\"Dairy and maple syrup (the leading producer by a wide margin), tourism and skiing, specialty foods, and semiconductors.\",\n",
    " hist:\"An independent republic from 1777 to 1791 and the first state admitted after the original thirteen. Its 1777 constitution was the first in North America to prohibit adult slavery and to extend suffrage without a property qualification. Billboards have been banned since 1968.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "VA:{n:\"Virginia\",cap:\"Richmond\",big:\"Virginia Beach\",adm:\"June 25, 1788\",ord:10,pop:8880107,pr:12,area:42775,ar:35,nick:\"Old Dominion\",reg:\"South\",div:\"South Atlantic\",tz:\"Eastern\",\n",
