    " geo:\"Five provinces run from the Atlantic inland: Tidewater, Piedmont, Blue Ridge, Ridge and Valley, and Appalachian Plateau. The Shenandoah Valley lies between the Blue Ridge and the Alleghenies. The Eastern Shore is cut off from the rest of the state by the Chesapeake Bay.\",\n",
    " feat:[\"Shenandoah Valley\",\"Blue Ridge Parkway\",\"Natural Bridge\",\"Great Dismal Swamp\",\"Luray Caverns\",\"Chincoteague\"],\n",
