    " hist:\"The only state formed by separating from another state: the western counties refused to leave the Union with Virginia and were admitted in 1863. The mine wars of 1920-21, culminating at Blair Mountain, were the largest armed labor uprising in American history.\"},\n",
    "\n",
    "WI:{n:\"Wisconsin\",cap:\"Madison\",big:\"Milwaukee\",adm:\"May 29, 1848\",ord:30,pop:5972787,pr:21,area:65496,ar:23,nick:\"Badger State\",reg:\"Midwest\",div:\"East North Central\",tz:\"Central\",\n",
