    " geo:\"The least populous state, with fewer residents than many single cities, and the second highest mean elevation. Yellowstone sits above one of the largest active volcanic systems on earth and contains roughly half the world's geysers. The Tetons rise 7,000 feet from the valley floor with no foothills at all.\",\n",
